================================================================================
Backend foundation for configurable UI branding (Tasks 1-3)
================================================================================

Context
-------
Implemented the backend baseline for Settings -> UI branding: immutable branding
normalization and palette derivation, unified `ui_branding` persistence with
legacy `navbar_logo` compatibility, and new atomic admin API routes.

Changes
-------
1. `src/back/core/helpers/UIBranding.py` + `src/back/core/helpers/__init__.py`
   - Added immutable `BrandPalette` and `UIBranding` dataclasses.
   - Added deterministic normalization/validation for title and `#RRGGBB` color.
   - Added derived palette generation (`dark`, `darker`, alpha variants),
     WCAG-based foreground selection, and serialization helpers.
2. `src/back/objects/session/GlobalConfigService.py`
   - Added default `ui_branding` object in `_empty()`.
   - Added `get_ui_branding()` and `set_ui_branding()` with normalization.
   - Preserved legacy `navbar_logo` read fallback when unified logo is empty.
   - Delegated legacy `get/set_navbar_logo` through unified branding storage.
   - Ensured cache state is preserved on failed unified branding persistence.
3. `src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py`
   - Added `get_ui_branding_result()` and atomic `save_ui_branding_result()`.
   - Reused existing logo MIME/size constraints through a shared logo validator.
   - Enforced reset/upload conflict validation and normalized payload writes.
   - Kept navbar-logo compatibility endpoints aligned with unified branding.
4. `src/api/routers/internal/settings.py`
   - Added admin `GET /settings/ui-branding`.
   - Added admin multipart `POST /settings/ui-branding` with
     `app_title` / `primary_color` / optional `logo_file` / `reset_logo`.
5. Tests
   - Added `tests/units/ui/test_branding.py`.
   - Added `tests/units/settings/test_ui_branding.py`.
   - Added `tests/units/api/test_ui_branding_settings.py`.

